	["Walk the loop and pick every {item:3821} (170, green), {object:2043} (185, green), {item:4625} (205, green, rare), {item:8831} (210, green), {item:8838} (230, yellow), {item:8839} (235, yellow), {item:8845} (245, orange), {item:8846} (250, orange), {item:13464} (260, orange) on the way until {skill:182} 285. {item:8845} grows in caves and dark hollows: look inside as well. {item:8831} sometimes gives a {item:8153} as well. {item:8846} grows near demon and satyr camps: pull carefully. The arrow takes the loop that gets you there soonest from where you are and walks it until the skill is reached; each loop keeps to creatures no more than a level above you and away from the other faction's towns, and the window names it and its lap. Expect about 50 herbs for these 25 points: about 20 {item:8839}, 20 {item:8838}, 10 {item:8831}, 10 {object:2043}, 5 {item:3821}, 5 {item:13464}, 5 {item:4625}, 5 {item:8845} and 5 {item:249274}. For {skill:171}: about 45 {item:8838} and 40 {item:3821} in all."] = "",

	-- Step 20: Mountain Silversage & Plaguebloom (285-300)
	-- {item:8831} Purple Lotus · {item:8836} Arthas' Tears · {item:8838} Sungrass · {item:8846} Gromsblood · {item:13464} Golden Sansam · {item:13463} Dreamfoil · {item:13465} Mountain Silversage · {item:13466} Plaguebloom · {skill:182} Herbalism · {item:8153} Wildvine · {npc:9528} Arathandris Silversky · {zone:1448} Felwood · {npc:9529} Maybess Riverbreeze · {skill:171} Alchemy
	["Walk the loop and pick every {item:8831} (210, green), {item:8836} (220, green), {item:8838} (230, green), {item:8846} (250, yellow, rare), {item:13464} (260, yellow), {item:13463} (270, orange), {item:13465} (280, orange), {item:13466} (285, orange) on the way until {skill:182} 300. {item:8831} sometimes gives a {item:8153} as well. {item:8846} grows near demon and satyr camps: pull carefully. Quests in these zones need {skill:182}: Salve via Gathering (level 55, {npc:9528}, {zone:1448}; Alliance), Salve via Gathering (level 55, {npc:9529}, {zone:1448}; Horde). The arrow takes the loop that gets you there soonest from where you are and walks it until the skill is reached; each loop keeps to creatures no more than a level above you and away from the other faction's towns, and the window names it and its lap. Expect about 20 herbs for these 15 points: about 5 {item:13463}, 5 {item:8831}, 5 {item:13465}, 5 {item:13464} and 5 {item:8838}. For {skill:171}: about 45 {item:8838} in all."] = "",

	-- No longer in the guide (its English changed or it went away): reuse or delete.
	-- ["Any {skill:182} trainer of your faction teaches Apprentice {skill:182} (character level 5); the arrow picks the nearest."] = "Любой учитель вашей фракции ({skill:182}) обучает навыку {skill:182}, ранг «Ученик» (уровень персонажа 5); стрелка ведет к ближайшему.",
	-- ["Journeyman {skill:182} raises the cap to 150; it needs skill 50 and character level 10. The arrow picks the nearest {skill:182} trainer of your faction."] = "{skill:182}, ранг «Подмастерье»: предел 150; нужен навык 50 и уровень персонажа 10. Стрелка ведет к ближайшему учителю вашей фракции ({skill:182}).",
